Use shrunken LFCs for ranking, plots, and GSEA. Use the Wald p-values from
 results() for significance (apeglm s-values are an alternative).

======================================================================
  6. Testing a biologically meaningful effect size
======================================================================
padj<.05 then |LFC|>1 post-hoc: 951 genes
 Formal test H0: |LFC| <= 1     : 223 genes
 The formal test is stricter -- and it is the one whose FDR is valid.

